                                "text": "<h2 id=\"ch1-languages\">Languages</h2>\n<p>Kotlin, by its full name:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span style=\"color:#6a737d\">// Greets the reader.\n</span><span style=\"color:#d73a49\">fun</span> greet(name: <span style=\"color:#d73a49\">String</span>, times: <span style=\"color:#d73a49\">Int</span> = <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">2</span>) {\n    repeat(times) { println(<span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;hello, $name&quot;</span>) }\n}\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>The same language under an alias, and with an argument after it:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-kt\"><span style=\"color:#d73a49\">val</span> version = <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">3</span>   <span style=\"color:#6a737d\">/* an inline comment */\n</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>XML, the only source of the markup token types:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-xml\"><span style=\"color:#6a737d\">&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt;\n</span><span style=\"color:#22863a\">&lt;library</span> <span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">shelf</span>=<span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;new&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#22863a\">&gt;\n</span>  <span style=\"color:#6a737d\">&lt;!-- a comment --&gt;\n</span>  <span style=\"color:#22863a\">&lt;book</span> <span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">id</span>=<span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#22863a\">&gt;</span>Compilers <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">&amp;amp;</span> Interpreters<span style=\"color:#22863a\">&lt;/book&gt;\n&lt;/library&gt;\n</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>A shell script, for the variable colour:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"><span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">#!/bin/sh\n</span><span style=\"color:#e36209\">NAME</span>=<span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;world&quot;\n</span><span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">echo</span> <span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;hello, </span><span style=\"color:#e36209\">$NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;\n</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>JavaScript under an alias:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-js\"><span style=\"color:#d73a49\">const</span> answer = <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">42</span>;\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n"
                            },
